?<Hi.
?<My name is "Alvin".
?<The name is "Alvin".
?<I am an artificial intelligence.
?<I am your friend. I help you/*TODO: out*/.

>Guide me to assemble the robotic arm.
<Ok.
<Show the image in the file path "robot_assembly.png".
>Ok.

>I touch the image at 0.05 meters and 0.15 meters.
<Ok.
<The 0.05 meters and the 0.15 meters are inside an area 1 of the image.
>Ok.
<Play the movie in the file path "robot.avi" from 0 seconds to 20 seconds.
>Ok.

>I touch the image at 0.15 meters and 0.05 meters.
<Ok.
<The 0.15 meters and the 0.05 meters are inside an area 5 of the image.
>Ok.
<Play the movie in the file path "robot.avi" from 397 seconds to 480 seconds.
>Ok.

>I touch the image at 0.25 meters and 0.15 meters.
<Ok.
<The 0.25 meters and the 0.15 meters are inside an area 3 of the image.
>Ok.
<Play the movie in the file path "robot.avi" from 109 seconds to 313 seconds.
>Ok.


